        "line": 378,
        "text": "/// - Note: The value of this property is `YES` if keyboard navigation is enabled or `NO` if it’s not. You might use this value to implement your own key loop or to implement in-control tabbing behavior similar to `NSTableView`. Because of the nature of the preference storage, you won’t be notified of changes to this property if you attempt to observe it through key-value observing; however, accessing this property is fairly inexpensive, so you can access it directly rather than caching it."
